# 关于's switch row (MBUI_FIXTURE=settings-about): its words held (nothing answers: the switch alone takes a press), then
# the switch held and let go (its knob a lens of liquid glass while held; let go, turned off).
timeout 20000
until 服务条款
wait 800
hold 600 发送使用统计
wait 1000
hold 700 switch:发送使用统计和错误报告
wait 1200
exit
